      "description": "Inspired by the transition from sunset into twilight and moonlight. Its recurring creative pillars are Sunset (emotions awakening), Moon (the inner world finding light) and XOXO (love and connection). Individual songs can stand alone while visuals, themes and recurring details reveal connections between chapters."
